<h2>Questions</h2>
<p>Please reach out to <a target="_blank" href="mailto:catalog@berkeley.edu" rel="noopener">catalog@berkeley.edu</a> with edits or corrections.</p>
<h2>Archives</h2>
<p>Archives of past academic years can be accessed at the top of each catalog using the &#8220;Archive&#8221; link.</p>
<p>If you are looking to search for available classes each semester (and class times), please see our <a href="http://classes.berkeley.edu">UC Berkeley Class Schedule</a>, classes.berkeley.edu.</p>
